    "title": "Dynamic Searchable Encryption via Blind Storage",
    "description": "Developing SSE scheme by using python and Django as a back-end and HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, jQuery for front-end of the application, which allows a client to store a blind data (encrypted with hashing) will be stored on server (Apache server) to prevent original data from any attacks.",
